{"id":"n57816-2-15","stage":3,"title":"무늬 · 花纹","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57816-2-15-1","ko":"이것 봐, 내가 그린 그림이야.","zh":"看啊，这是我画的画哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이것","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이것：这个","readings":[{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44878","senseId":"1","lemma":"이것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}},{"text":"봐,","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"그린","meaning":"画","explanation":"그리다：画；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"그리다","audio":"/audio/729cbc127a38cc4c4f21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57277","senseId":"1","lemma":"그리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그린","audio":"/audio/8b9236867da1c7c570bd.mp3"}},{"text":"그림이야.","meaning":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","explanation":"그림：画儿，绘画，画作，图画；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"그림","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29687","senseId":"1","lemma":"그림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그림이야","audio":"/audio/e6aec38e8f95bc18a58a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e414d84c28c86213","term":"이것","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3","entryId":"44878","definition":"指代与说话人较近或说话人所想的东西。","pronunciation":["이걷"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"729cbc127a38cc4c","term":"그리다","zh":"画","audio":"/audio/729cbc127a38cc4c4f21.mp3","entryId":"57277","definition":"利用铅笔或毛笔等以线条或色彩来表现事物。","pronunciation":["그ː리다"]},{"id":"c143fe9e8e3a2db7","term":"그림","zh":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3","entryId":"29687","definition":"用线条或色彩把事物的模样或形象等表现在平面上的东西。","pronunciation":["그ː림"]}],"audio":"/audio/99b30546e40e28d07fc7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57816-2-15-2","ko":"우와, 여러 가지 무늬가 예쁘게 조화를 이루고 있네.","zh":"哇，各种图案搭配得真漂亮，十分和谐呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우와,","meaning":"哇","explanation":"우와：哇","readings":[{"term":"우와","audio":"/audio/2d727fbbe4b971d2bc9b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:우와:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"우와","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우와","audio":"/audio/2d727fbbe4b971d2bc9b.mp3"}},{"text":"여러","meaning":"多个，许多，多种","explanation":"여러：多个，许多，多种","readings":[{"term":"여러","audio":"/audio/9132eb626207a0b02762.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17300","senseId":"1","lemma":"여러","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여러","audio":"/audio/9132eb626207a0b02762.mp3"}},{"text":"가지","meaning":"种，项，类别，个","explanation":"가지：种，项，类别，个","readings":[{"term":"가지","audio":"/audio/b16bec1ce2b9561977e6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59921","senseId":"1","lemma":"가지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가지","audio":"/audio/b16bec1ce2b9561977e6.mp3"}},{"text":"무늬가","meaning":"花纹，纹样，图案","explanation":"무늬：花纹，纹样，图案；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"무늬","audio":"/audio/a56d8b4782da19dc7be9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57816","senseId":"2","lemma":"무늬","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무늬가","audio":"/audio/4995638e1bebad8c49c1.mp3"}},{"text":"예쁘게","meaning":"漂亮，好看","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예쁘게","audio":"/audio/34e05a9677358184f75a.mp3"}},{"text":"조화를","meaning":"协调，和谐","explanation":"조화：协调，和谐；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"조화","audio":"/audio/c109b707f655ea5b2429.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"76044","senseId":"1","lemma":"조화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조화를","audio":"/audio/391ed5918415d75f7085.mp3"}},{"text":"이루고","meaning":"构成，形成","explanation":"이루다：构成，形成；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이루다","audio":"/audio/716d818197486a2c3f7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66315","senseId":"3","lemma":"이루다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이루고","audio":"/audio/5292579d64fa5cfa45df.mp3"}},{"text":"있네.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있네","audio":"/audio/a43e47a1fb823079c63a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2d727fbbe4b971d2","term":"우와","zh":"哇","audio":"/audio/2d727fbbe4b971d2bc9b.mp3","definition":"惊讶、赞叹时的感叹。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"9132eb626207a0b0","term":"여러","zh":"多个，许多，多种","audio":"/audio/9132eb626207a0b02762.mp3","entryId":"17300","definition":"很多数量的。","pronunciation":["여러"]},{"id":"b16bec1ce2b95619","term":"가지","zh":"种，项，类别，个","audio":"/audio/b16bec1ce2b9561977e6.mp3","entryId":"59921","definition":"表示事物种类的数量单位。","pronunciation":["가지"]},{"id":"a56d8b4782da19dc","term":"무늬","zh":"花纹，纹样，图案","audio":"/audio/a56d8b4782da19dc7be9.mp3","entryId":"57816","definition":"以装饰为目的雕刻的各种图样。","pronunciation":["무니"]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮，好看","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"长相看起来美丽，让人喜欢。","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]},{"id":"c109b707f655ea5b","term":"조화","zh":"协调，和谐","audio":"/audio/c109b707f655ea5b2429.mp3","entryId":"76044","definition":"相互很融洽。","pronunciation":["조화"]},{"id":"716d818197486a2c","term":"이루다","zh":"构成，形成","audio":"/audio/716d818197486a2c3f7c.mp3","entryId":"66315","definition":"多个事物聚在一起，组成具有某种性质或模样的东西。","pronunciation":["이루다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e6a42c802d1d20d29159.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.165,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=57816","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":114,"sequenceScore":2.9917,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["看啊，这是我画的画哦。","哇，各种图案搭配得真漂亮，十分和谐呢。","智秀，这些数学题都做完了吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["看啊，这是我画的画哦。","哇，各种图案搭配得真漂亮，十分和谐呢。","智秀，这些数学题都做完了吗？"],"answer":1}]}
